              "type": "text",
              "id": "T15S7",
              "name": "Description",
              "fill": "$color-accent-4",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 816,
              "content": "20 columns × 46px with a 1.5rem (24px) gutter — always the same value as the block gap ($spacing-40), on mobile too. Content spans the middle 12 columns (cols 5–16) = 51rem; wide spans all 20 = 86rem. 4 cols = 16rem, so content splits into thirds on whole rems. The page margin is 1.5rem ($spacing-40) on every viewport, the same as the gutter; the 86rem wide area centers, so at 1584px it leaves 6.5rem (104px) on each side. On mobile the grid becomes 6 columns (half of the 12 content columns).",
              "lineHeight": 1.75,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family-noto-sans-jp",
